# A directory *literally named* `~`, which the old default created because
# `fs.mkdir` has no shell in it and never expanded the tilde. Ignored rather
# than assumed gone: any build predating `9bfcbdf` still writes one, and a
# session's history was committed from this exact path once.
~/
