.refdiff/
docs/refdiff/*.txt

# **Outputs and scratch, never the record** (review batch 2, M4 item 5). 684
# files and ~92 MB of these were committed. A finding keeps its evidence in
# its own text: of 38 `out/` probes FINDINGS cites, 36 are in no tree and
# the entries still stand, because each carries what its probe measured.
# `captures/` is capture-foreign's default output; `out/` is the probes' and
# the mutation sweep's (`out/mutate-sweep/`, recreated by `sweep.mjs`).
captures/
out/
/*.zip
/probe-*.mjs
/.mut-seam.out
*.swp
*.swo
.swp
.swo
*.bak
